{"type":"text","timestamp":1794306777210,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c504a057001M1ue04x0s1IQQn","messageID":"msg_1c5049576001iSBklbTgAfUu4z","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>Let me check the environment: python version, node version, npm registry access, pip cache.\n\nLet me plan:\n- Backend: Flask app with SQLite storage in ./data, auth with tokens (signed with itsdangerous or simple secrets), weather reports CRUD, lookups, pagination.\n- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS.\n\nTailwind CSS needs to be installed as a dependency. Let's check npm registry availability.\n\nLet me check tool versions.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794306777175,"end":1794306777205}}}
