{"type":"text","timestamp":1794306821749,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c5054e49001BG9jMbQP77TiuX","messageID":"msg_1c5053f06001jjIm5nw83JrEmn","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>Flask isn't installed locally in the system python. I'll create a venv in /workspace/.venv (gitignored? check .gitignore) or install with --break-system-packages. Let me check .gitignore exists.\n\nAlso /tmp/opencode permission denied - let me use /workspace/.venv instead.\n\nLet me check .gitignore.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794306821705,"end":1794306821742}}}
