{"type":"text","timestamp":1794306923492,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c506dbd4001nX6VktAvms7NEr","messageID":"msg_1c506cfa3001sQxXyF0ePi96wu","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>Now add the module-level init at the end of app.py (before `if __name__ == \"__main__\"`), and remove the duplicate init in __main__.\n\nAlso, the `init_store()` call at import time.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794306923476,"end":1794306923489}}}
