{"type":"text","timestamp":1794306928342,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c506eeaa0014YrQv1KQs0fr7c","messageID":"msg_1c506dbf7001nti9zsqc5muDNy","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>Now let me test the backend quickly. I'll write a test script that exercises the API using Flask's test client.\n\nLet me create a test script at /workspace/backend/test_api.py? Hmm — adding a test file to the repo is fine (it's good practice) but the task says don't create files unnecessarily. A test script is useful. I'll put it in /workspace/tests/test_api.py maybe. Let me create it as a proper pytest-free script using unittest so it can be run with python -m unittest.\n\nActually, let me first do a quick manual smoke test with the test client in a scratch script under /tmp (but /tmp/opencode had permission issues; the error was for /tmp/opencode/piptest — \"Permission denied\" for mkdir? It said PermissionError creating '/tmp/opencode/piptest'. Odd since /tmp/opencode should be pre-approved. Maybe the shell user can't write there. Let me test quickly.)\n\nI'll just write the test file in the repo at /workspace/tests/test_api.py — it's a legitimate addition, and useful for verification. Let me check if /tmp/opencode is writable.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794306928298,"end":1794306928314}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794306928342,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c506ebed77d9abc0ac34","state":{"status":"error","input":{"command":"ls -ld /tmp/opencode 2>&1; touch /tmp/opencode/x 2>&1 && echo writable; ls -ld /tmp"},"error":"The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call. Here are some of the relevant rules [{\"permission\":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"*\",\"action\":\"ask\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"/run/home/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/*\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"/tmp/opencode/*\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"action\":\"deny\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"external_directory\",\"pattern\":\"/run/home/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/*\",\"action\":\"allow\"}]","time":{"start":1794306928310,"end":1794306928320}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c506eeae001rpHe27QvuXPKDW","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","messageID":"msg_1c506dbf7001nti9zsqc5muDNy"}}
