{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794307056112,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c508e1cf001w2vH634T88dMRD","messageID":"msg_1c508c27e001vp6N2W5pHNjXWW","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794307056112,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c508e1d2001CEpzS4U51IoCtl","messageID":"msg_1c508c27e001vp6N2W5pHNjXWW","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the formatting helpers and components.\n\nformat.ts:\n```ts\nimport type { Unit } from \"./types\";\n\nexport function celsiusToFahrenheit(celsius: number): number {\n  return (celsius * 9) / 5 + 32;\n}\n\nexport function convertTemperature(celsius: number | null, unit: Unit): number | null {\n  if (celsius === null || celsius === undefined || Number.isNaN(celsius)) return null;\n  return unit === \"F\" ? celsiusToFahrenheit(celsius) : celsius;\n}\n\nexport function formatTemperature(celsius: number | null, unit: Unit): string {\n  const value = convertTemperature(celsius, unit);\n  if (value === null) return \"—\";\n  return `${value.toFixed(1)}°${unit}`;\n}\n\nexport function formatTimestamp(value: string | null | undefined): string {\n  if (!value) return \"—\";\n  const date = new Date(value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) return value;\n  return date.toLocaleString(undefined, { dateStyle: \"medium\", timeStyle: \"short\" });\n}\n```\n\nNow components. Let me write:\n\n1. `src/components/UnitToggle.tsx`\n2. `src/components/AuthPanel.tsx`\n3. `src/components/SearchPanel.tsx`\n4. `src/components/WeatherCard.tsx`\n5. `src/components/RecentLookups.tsx`\n6. `src/components/ReportsPanel.tsx`\n\nApp.tsx ties it together.\n\nLet me write them.\n\nSearchPanel: props { onSearch(city), loading }. Contains the input + submit. I'll keep the input state inside SearchPanel and call onSearch(value).\n\nWeatherCard: props { report, unit }.\n\nRecentLookups: props { lookups, onSelect(city) }.\n\nReportsPanel: props { unit, onChanged } — handles its own list state and forms, calling the API directly.\n\nAuthPanel: props { onSignedIn(username) } — handles login/register.\n\nLet me write the code carefully with proper TS types.\n\nFor the ReportsPanel add/edit form, I'll create a `ReportForm` component:\n\n```tsx\ninterface ReportFormProps {\n  title: string;\n  initial?: ReportInput;\n  submitLabel: string;\n  onSubmit: (input: ReportInput) => Promise<void>;\n  onCancel?: () => void;\n}\n```\nwith internal state and error handling:\n```tsx\nconst [values, setValues] = useState<ReportInput>(initial ?? emptyInput);\nconst [errors, setErrors] = useState<Record<string,string>>({});\nconst [message, setMessage] = useState<string | null>(null);\nconst [saving, setSaving] = useState(false);\n\nasync function handleSubmit(e) {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  setSaving(true); setErrors({}); setMessage(null);\n  try {\n    await onSubmit(values);\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n      setErrors(error.errors);\n      setMessage(error.message);\n    } else {\n      setMessage(\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\");\n    }\n  } finally { setSaving(false); }\n}\n```\n\nFields with error text under each input.\n\nNote: the API's PUT clears omitted fields; the edit form sends only non-empty optional fields (matching the PUT semantics). Good — the form shows all fields; empty ones are omitted → cleared.\n\nNow the delete confirmation with window.confirm.\n\nLet me write the files.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794307056083,"end":1794307056103}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794307056112,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c508d78f7693864921be","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import type { Unit } from \"./types\";\n\nexport function celsiusToFahrenheit(celsius: number): number {\n  return (celsius * 9) / 5 + 32;\n}\n\nexport function convertTemperature(celsius: number | null, unit: Unit): number | null {\n  if (celsius === null || celsius === undefined || Number.isNaN(celsius)) {\n    return null;\n  }\n  return unit === \"F\" ? celsiusToFahrenheit(celsius) : celsius;\n}\n\nexport function formatTemperature(celsius: number | null, unit: Unit): string {\n  const value = convertTemperature(celsius, unit);\n  if (value === null) {\n    return \"—\";\n  }\n  return `${value.toFixed(1)}°${unit}`;\n}\n\nexport function formatTimestamp(value: string | null | undefined): string {\n  if (!value) {\n    return \"—\";\n  }\n  const date = new Date(value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) {\n    return value;\n  }\n  return date.toLocaleString(undefined, { dateStyle: \"medium\", timeStyle: \"short\" });\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/format.ts"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/format.ts","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/format.ts","time":{"start":1794307056093,"end":1794307056109}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c508e1d6001Be0cpSxMXrLYZl","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","messageID":"msg_1c508c27e001vp6N2W5pHNjXWW"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794307056161,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c508db407075bbced5e0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import type { Unit } from \"../types\";\n\ninterface UnitToggleProps {\n  unit: Unit;\n  onChange: (unit: Unit) => void;\n}\n\nexport default function UnitToggle({ unit, onChange }: UnitToggleProps) {\n  return (\n    <div\n      className=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-slate-100 p-1\"\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-label=\"Temperature unit\"\n    >\n      {([\"C\", \"F\"] as Unit[]).map((option) => (\n        <button\n          key={option}\n          type=\"button\"\n          onClick={() => onChange(option)}\n          aria-pressed={unit === option}\n          className={`rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold transition ${\n            unit === option\n              ? \"bg-sky-600 text-white shadow-sm\"\n              : \"text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\"\n          }`}\n        >\n          °{option}\n        </button>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/UnitToggle.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/UnitToggle.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/UnitToggle.tsx","time":{"start":1794307056100,"end":1794307056135}},"id":"prt_1c508e1e0001TLZ8V1sqaYCRDE","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","messageID":"msg_1c508c27e001vp6N2W5pHNjXWW"}}
