{"type":"text","timestamp":1794307118849,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c509d6ed001MgZbAP6C8tDrwK","messageID":"msg_1c509c9c7001L3OGLURXeEk0I6","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>The build works. Let me check the generated CSS contains Tailwind utilities (16KB - yes, Tailwind v4 output).\n\nNow let me run the whole app locally and test end-to-end: start the Flask app with the venv python, then curl the API, and check the frontend is served.\n\nNote: the backend serves DIST from /workspace/frontend/dist (since backend/app.py's parent.parent = /workspace). ✓\n\nLet me start the server on port 8000 in the background with a test data dir.\n\nActually, I should test with the real data dir ./data to verify persistence. Let me run from /workspace so ./data is created there. But that pollutes the repo dir with a data/ folder — that's expected (\"Persistent data lives under ./data\"). I'll add data/ to .gitignore.\n\nLet me start the server.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794307118829,"end":1794307118845}}}
