{"type":"text","timestamp":1794307132155,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c50a0acb001Rkl6FJtojz32SG","messageID":"msg_1c509fa56001DTqt12TguV0rUE","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>All good. Now test PUT and DELETE.\n\nNote: the lookup for \"oslo\" recorded the city as typed (\"oslo\"). The frontend displays the lookup city as typed. That's fine.\n\nHmm, one consideration: when the user clicks a recent lookup for \"oslo\", the search shows the \"Oslo\" report. Good.\n\nNow PUT/DELETE.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794307132107,"end":1794307132148}}}
