{"type":"text","timestamp":1794307136200,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c50a1a9c001JpvlE9MthJy3ay","messageID":"msg_1c50a0c5a001a6Hbbkajf33Qb1","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>The API works as designed.\n\nNow let me verify the frontend in a browser. Is Playwright available in the sandbox? Let me check. If not, I'll at least verify the built HTML/JS and do a careful review. Let me check for playwright/chromium.\n\nAlso I should double-check a few frontend behaviors by reasoning:\n1. The recent lookups list loads on mount — requires the /api/weather/recent endpoint ✓.\n2. The unit toggle converts card temperature and report list temperatures ✓.\n\nLet me check if there's a browser available for a smoke test.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794307136156,"end":1794307136195}}}
