{"type":"text","timestamp":1794307670897,"sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","part":{"id":"prt_1c5124360001sQWcm74liyfLoH","messageID":"msg_1c512385f001NRiVau1KxktLwM","sessionID":"ses_e3afb8e6dffemZh34YunfKALwC","type":"text","text":"<think>Everything got cleaned up (including .lockcheck and .e2e) and the server processes are dead. The `.venv` and `.token` and `server.log` remain — I'll clean those up later (.venv is needed for testing; I'll remove it at the end or gitignore it).\n\nNow let me start gunicorn properly.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794307670880,"end":1794307670894}}}
